RPC URL for Sepolia (Alchemy, Infura, or a public endpoint).
SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=https://sepolia.example/YOUR_KEY

Deployer key for a test account. Leave empty until you fill .env locally.
Never commit .env or a real private key.
PRIVATE_KEY=

Optional whole-token supply minted to the deployer (18 decimals).
Default 0 so attested mints can use the 1000000 ECO cap. A value of 1000000 or above reverts.
INITIAL_SUPPLY=0

Optional RPC for the generic l2 network in hardhat.config.js.
L2_RPC_URL=

Optional. When set, a Sepolia deploy verifies the source on Etherscan.
ETHERSCAN_API_KEY=

Backend session cookie secret. Required when NODE_ENV=production.
SESSION_SECRET=

Comma-separated wallet addresses allowed to review submissions.
ADMIN_ADDRESSES=

Website origin and SIWE domain.
APP_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
APP_DOMAIN=localhost

Optional. The API keeps using memory until a Prisma repository is connected.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://eco:eco@localhost:5432/eco

Optional object storage. Video upload stays disabled until these are set.
S3_BUCKET=
S3_REGION=
S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=

Optional AI service. The API does not invent a verification result when this is empty.
AI_SERVICE_URL=

Website public configuration. Do not put private keys here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
NEXT_PUBLIC_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_ECO_TOKEN_ADDRESS=
NEXT_PUBLIC_ECO_STAKING_ADDRESS=
